620					<h3>Live Region Example</h3>
621					<p>Click the button to announce a message using a live region. This demonstrates how screen readers are notified of dynamic updates.</p>
622					<button id="announce" type="button">Announce message</button>
623					<div class="live-region" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
624						<span id="live-message"></span>
625					</div>
626				</article>
