644				<h2 id="accessibility">Accessibility Features</h2>
645				<article class="card">
646					<h3>Data Table Example</h3>
647					<p>Accessible tables have proper headers, captions, and semantic structure for screen readers.</p>
648					<table>
649						<caption>Browser compatibility for modern features</caption>
650						<thead>
651							<tr>
